        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/0af7b48c64833224bb7d1ee1003e7e17.avif?t=1769615321\" width=1295 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Are you ready to face the flames and become a hero? 🔥</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the flames to rescue civilians and cute pets trapped in buildings, then escape before everything collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire Hero is a retro pixel art puzzle-platformer game, entirely hand-drawn. Play as the new recruit at Station 38 and discover your connection to the strange events shaking the city. Experience an intense and immersive narrative adventure, blending action and emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/81b368f64d226e04cb0d2207445decaf.poster.avif?t=1769615321\" width=682 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/81b368f64d226e04cb0d2207445decaf.webm?t=1769615321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through more than 30 levels with varied puzzles and mechanics. Fight the flames, face poisoned zones, and beware of electricity! Use the tools at your disposal, like the fire extinguisher or the axe, to progress through the different stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/a2fd194a09d07731f8dae546a5bfdfd6.poster.avif?t=1769615321\" width=683 height=257 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/a2fd194a09d07731f8dae546a5bfdfd6.webm?t=1769615321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over 100 mini-puzzles, inspired by classic platformers and Sokoban. Use the environment to your advantage to overcome fires and conquer dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/4a4993cacbd7afb1970749b22b790b73.poster.avif?t=1769615321\" width=682 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/4a4993cacbd7afb1970749b22b790b73.webm?t=1769615321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 unique environments to uncover Sophia's past and reveal the secrets of Brigade 38 through multiple narrative arcs leading to a fantasy-tinged conclusion, revealing your true role in this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/00a92e22dc9fee83ec5662355804c223.poster.avif?t=1769615321\" width=683 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/00a92e22dc9fee83ec5662355804c223.webm?t=1769615321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden animals and secrets scattered throughout the levels to try to unveil the mysteries of Fire Hero. Unlock bonus levels and reach the true ending of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measure your performance: beat your records and achieve S rank in each level by crushing the best times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Are you ready to face the flames and become a hero? 🔥</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/0af7b48c64833224bb7d1ee1003e7e17.avif?t=1769615321\" width=1295 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Are you ready to face the flames and become a hero? 🔥</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the flames to rescue civilians and cute pets trapped in buildings, then escape before everything collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire Hero is a retro pixel art puzzle-platformer game, entirely hand-drawn. Play as the new recruit at Station 38 and discover your connection to the strange events shaking the city. Experience an intense and immersive narrative adventure, blending action and emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/81b368f64d226e04cb0d2207445decaf.poster.avif?t=1769615321\" width=682 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/81b368f64d226e04cb0d2207445decaf.webm?t=1769615321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through more than 30 levels with varied puzzles and mechanics. Fight the flames, face poisoned zones, and beware of electricity! Use the tools at your disposal, like the fire extinguisher or the axe, to progress through the different stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/a2fd194a09d07731f8dae546a5bfdfd6.poster.avif?t=1769615321\" width=683 height=257 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/a2fd194a09d07731f8dae546a5bfdfd6.webm?t=1769615321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over 100 mini-puzzles, inspired by classic platformers and Sokoban. Use the environment to your advantage to overcome fires and conquer dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/4a4993cacbd7afb1970749b22b790b73.poster.avif?t=1769615321\" width=682 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/4a4993cacbd7afb1970749b22b790b73.webm?t=1769615321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 unique environments to uncover Sophia's past and reveal the secrets of Brigade 38 through multiple narrative arcs leading to a fantasy-tinged conclusion, revealing your true role in this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/00a92e22dc9fee83ec5662355804c223.poster.avif?t=1769615321\" width=683 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403090/extras/00a92e22dc9fee83ec5662355804c223.webm?t=1769615321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for hidden animals and secrets scattered throughout the levels to try to unveil the mysteries of Fire Hero. Unlock bonus levels and reach the true ending of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measure your performance: beat your records and achieve S rank in each level by crushing the best times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Are you ready to face the flames and become a hero? 🔥</p>",
